	abstract = {We compare the results of the unified Monte Carlo chemical model with 
the new modified-rate equation (MRE) method under a wide range of
interstellar conditions, using a full gas-grain chemical network. In
most of the explored parameter space, the new MRE method reproduces very
well the results of the exact approach. Small disagreements between the
methods may be remedied by the use of a more complete surface chemistry
network, appropriate to the full range of temperatures employed here.},
