	abstract = {This paper reports the results of a laboratory investigation of ion/molecule reactions of the C3H6N+ isomers. CH3CNCH+3, C2H5NCH+ and C2H5CNH+. The C3H6H+ association products of the ion/molecule reactions HCNH+ + C2H4 and CH+3 + CH3CN were also examined. The product of HCNH+ + C2H4 was found to be either C2H5NCH+ or CH2CHCHNH+2 and that of CH+3 + CH3CN was CH3CNCH+3. Thus neither association reaction produces a C3H6+ ion having the C2H5CNH+ structure. Implications for the interstellar synthesis of C2H5CN are discussed.},
